#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gtk4-ding.gschema.xml:56
#, machine-translated
msgid "When adding drives and volumes to the desktop, add them to the opposite side of the screen."
msgstr "Ketika menambahkan drive dan volume ke desktop, tambahkan mereka ke sisi berlawanan layar."

# MT: LibreTranslate
#: schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.gtk4-ding.gschema.xml:60
#, machine-translated
